rom 'Monitor Reaction' to 'Cool Solution'. Multiple 'Monitor Reaction'-'Cool Solution' pairs can exist in a process instance, each adhering to this immediate succession rule. Events of 'Cool Solution' are allowed to happen elsewhere in the process but not between a 'Monitor Reaction' and its corresponding 'Cool Solution'.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Reaction\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Reaction' activity tracks the status and time of the ongoing chemical reaction.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Cool Solution\",\"description\":\"The 'Cool Solution' activity cools down the reacted mixture to a safe temperature for further handling.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,10,m\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Filter Product' activity is permitted to occur only if a 'Cool Solution' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance. 'Filter Product' that occur without any prior 'Cool Solution' are violations of the constraint. Multiple 'Cool Solution' can occur, and any number of events (including other activities) can happen between a 'Cool Solution' and a subsequent 'Filter Product'.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Filter Product\",\"description\":\"The 'Filter Product' activity separates the solid product from the liquid by filtration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Cool Solution\",\"description\":\"The 'Cool Solution' activity cools down the reacted mixture to a safe temperature for further handling.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever a 'Filter Product' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Dry Product' activity, with no other events in between. Conversely, whenever a 'Dry Product' activity occurs, it must be immediately preceded by a 'Filter Product' activity, with no other events in between. This enforces a strict one-to-one and immediate pairing of 'Filter Product' and 'Dry Product', ensuring that neither occurs without the other and that they occur consecutively without interruption.\",\"template\":\"Chain Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Filter Product\",\"description\":\"The 'Filter Product' activity separates the solid product from the liquid by filtration.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Dry Product\",\"description\":\"The 'Dry Product' activity removes moisture from the filtered product to obtain the dry form.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Dry Product' activity occurs, then a 'Analyze Sample' activity must eventually occur after the 'Dry Product' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Dry Product' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Analyze Sample' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Dry Product'. If 'Dry Product' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Analyze Sample'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Dry Product\",\"description\":\"The 'Dry Product' activity removes moisture from the filtered product to obtain the dry form.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Sample\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Sample' activity examines the purity and yield of the dried product sample.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,1,d\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If an 'Analyze Sample' activity occurs, then a 'Store Product' must occur after that 'Analyze Sample' event and before any subsequent 'Analyze Sample' occurs; no other occurrence of 'Analyze Sample' is allowed between an 'Analyze Sample' and its corresponding 'Store Product'. This ensures that each 'Analyze Sample'